It is now afternoon.
Outside, the rain falls steadily.
Anitha gives me hot kanji.
I drink that kanji.
I must take the medicine after eating food.
I take the cough syrup.
I drink hot water, as the doctor said.
I must rest well to get over the sickness quickly.
I go to my bedroom.
I lie down on the bed.
I take a blanket and cover myself.
It is nice and warm under it.
I hear the sound of the rain falling outside the window.
I must sleep now.
I close my eyes.
